Example data
------------

The bundled `pik3ca_tcga_brca` example is an aggregate derived from the
open-access NCI Genomic Data Commons TCGA-BRCA masked somatic mutation data.
It contains mutation-level distinct-sample counts and no sample identifiers.
Source: https://portal.gdc.cancer.gov/projects/TCGA-BRCA

The results shown here are in whole or part based upon data generated by the
TCGA Research Network: https://www.cancer.gov/tcga

PIK3CA and FLT3 domain annotations shown in the package documentation are
derived from UniProt and InterPro records. Copyrightable parts of UniProt
databases are available under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International license: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

InterPro downloadable data are available under the CC0 1.0 Universal Public
Domain Dedication: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/interpro/about/license/
